{"name": "Dice Factory", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/8e40417c3f715aed2251dfc7de45344c.poster.avif?t=1787602121\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/8e40417c3f715aed2251dfc7de45344c.webm?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/8e40417c3f715aed2251dfc7de45344c.mp4?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/9a96eea0a225d00038459bfd7d1c12dc.poster.avif?t=1787602121\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/9a96eea0a225d00038459bfd7d1c12dc.webm?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/9a96eea0a225d00038459bfd7d1c12dc.mp4?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice Factory</strong> is a Dice-Powered City Builder where every throw shapes your kingdom! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Every die can become a building, resource or unit. Grow intricate production chains, recruit powerful armies, and defend your Castle against waves of enemies and epic bosses!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Expand from humble resource gathering into an interconnected economy of over <strong>100 unique buildings</strong>. Use your Workers, recruit soldiers, upgrade every building just to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Will you take greater risks for greater prizes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/6a203e9b391f3f36d79842ddc66d2c43.poster.avif?t=1787602121\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/6a203e9b391f3f36d79842ddc66d2c43.webm?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/6a203e9b391f3f36d79842ddc66d2c43.mp4?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/398764626c1735df4695dbebc925d13e.poster.avif?t=1787602121\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/398764626c1735df4695dbebc925d13e.webm?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/398764626c1735df4695dbebc925d13e.mp4?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Four waves stand between you and the next stage, with a powerful boss leading the final assault.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A thriving economy is only as strong as the army it supports. Every production chain, every building you supply, and every throw you make determines whether your kingdom survives the invasion.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Complete runs to unlock new <strong>Buildings</strong>, expanding your future kingdoms. Master all five worlds, then push your strategy even further with <strong>10 Ordeal levels</strong>, each introducing new challenges.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"100\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/97f2dfa6bded5d1d214cea697df51d4f.poster.avif?t=1787602121\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/97f2dfa6bded5d1d214cea697df51d4f.webm?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/97f2dfa6bded5d1d214cea697df51d4f.mp4?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"250\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/9e021d181cf66df2ba1dfec85aadd969.poster.avif?t=1787602121\" width=\"780\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/9e021d181cf66df2ba1dfec85aadd969.webm?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/extras/9e021d181cf66df2ba1dfec85aadd969.mp4?t=1787602121\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dice-Powered Kingdom Builder</strong> - Dice to rule them all... Everything is a die in this game!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Every Throw Matters</strong>\u00a0- Keep your production chains running with your aim</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>100+ buildings\u00a0</strong>- Many buildings to discover, from resource production to spinning a wheel to gain prizes or even aiming at Train going through your Kingdom!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Divination System</strong> - Reveal upcoming enemies and rewards, you can decide how much you want to risk. Greater rewards come with greater danger!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Defend Your Castle</strong> - Survive waves of enemies, culminating in challenging boss battles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Roguelite Runs</strong> - Every run will unlock new Buildings and Artefacts that expand the pool of possibilities for your future Kingdoms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Ordeals\u00a0</strong>- Conquer 10 escalating difficulty levels with stacking modifiers.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><i>You will love Dice Factory if you enjoy</i></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>The King is Watching, Thronefall, Bad North,  Against the Storm, 9 Kings, Super Fantasy Kingdom, Diplomacy is Not an Option, Northgard and many more RTS unique style games!</i></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Dice Factory is a Dice-Powered City Builder where every throw shapes your kingdom. Every die can become a building, resource or unit. Grow intricate production chains, recruit powerful armies, and defend your Castle against waves of enemies and epic bosses!", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4838990/db4310a2b29582d93da986e0deecd9b47580a51c/header.jpg?t=1787602121", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["3D", "Auto Battler", "Base Building", "Indie", "Building", "City Builder"], "developers": "mrTodo", "publishers": "mrTodo", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "4838990", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "10 August 2026 - Request Access\n\n29 August 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/ckauL5paPjM", "first_seen": 1786312800.0, "review_rank": 1